q=A.aub(A.b([o,m,A.kw(A.b([a1,"Set up and structured the application, implementing a core base architecture using Bloc","Developed Dart scripts to automate and accelerate project setup based on the defined architecture"],p),A.b([a3,"Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp v\xe0 c\u1ea5u tr\xfac \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng, tri\u1ec3n khai ki\u1ebfn tr\xfac core base s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Bloc","Ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n Dart scripts \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng h\xf3a v\xe0 \u0111\u1ea9y nhanh qu\xe1 tr\xecnh thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp d\u1ef1 \xe1n theo ki\u1ebfn tr\xfac \u0111\xe3 \u0111\u1ecbnh"],p),"An attendance management application for Atin company employees, enabling users to track daily attendance, working hours, and statuses with detailed monthly records. The app supports mobile-based check-in, leave and overtime requests, role-based access control, and multi-language customization.","\u1ee8ng d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ea3n l\xfd ch\u1ea5m c\xf4ng cho nh\xe2n vi\xean c\xf4ng ty Atin, cho ph\xe9p theo d\xf5i ch\u1ea5m c\xf4ng h\xe0ng ng\xe0y, gi\u1edd l\xe0m vi\u1ec7c v\xe0 tr\u1ea1ng th\xe1i v\u1edbi b\u1ea3n ghi chi ti\u1ebft theo th\xe1ng. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ch\u1ea5m c\xf4ng qua \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, y\xeau c\u1ea7u ngh\u1ec9 ph\xe9p v\xe0 l\xe0m th\xeam gi\u1edd, ph\xe2n quy\u1ec1n vai tr\xf2 v\xe0 t\xf9y ch\u1ec9nh \u0111a ng\xf4n ng\u1eef.","assets/atin_timekeeping.png",l,i,"Atin Timekeeping",g,g,g,a0,q)],j),new A.BZ(500,20,20,1.5),new A.b6(0,20,0,20),B.kk,!0)
